@ The gym leaders, in their own words. (Hisham's Petalburg gym is in family.inc, with the twist.)
@ 1 KAREEM: a random guy, and a dentist. Heard you called him random and a D-tier MOVERSE character.
@ 2 JELAL: chain and scrubs. Works with MO at ALLSUPPORT, and loves it.
@ 3 SAMMI B: SAMMI MUTHAFUCKIN B. Collects POKéMON cards: asks about rare ones, tells you his pulls.
@ 4 ANAS TRESH: "Hello, my name is ANAS TRESH." A urologist who heard you called him a piss doctor.
@ 6 ADAM JABER: all energy and jokes. Loves guns and ZAREEN's, and the time YASEEN ate crumble
@   cookies with ants in them. Now he adds ants to everything.
@ 7 OMAR HAFIZ and MO ABDU: nobody knows anything about them. "… … …" "We're MO's friends."
@ 8 HANY: the leader of EGYPT. Loves EGYPT, KOSHARY and DAAH, and talks to his META glasses right
@   before and after the battle. He heard you talking trash about EGYPT in the WORLD CUP.

@@ file: data/maps/RustboroCity_Gym/scripts.inc
RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneIntro:
	.string "Hello. I'm KAREEM, the RUSTBORO\n"
	.string "GYM LEADER. Also a dentist.\p"
	.string "I heard what you said about me.\p"
	.string "“KAREEM? Who's that? Some random\n"
	.string "guy? D-tier MOVERSE character.”\p"
	.string "D-tier?!\n"
	.string "I do people's TEETH!\p"
	.string "That's at least B-tier.\p"
	.string "Open wide.\n"
	.string "This is going to hurt.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneDefeat:
	.string "So…\n"
	.string "I lost…\p"
	.string "To someone who thinks I'm random.\p"
	.string "Fine. The POKéMON LEAGUE says I\n"
	.string "have to give you this.\p"
	.string "Here's the STONE BADGE.\n"
	.string "Floss daily.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_StoneBadgeInfoTakeThis:
	.string "The STONE BADGE heightens the ATTACK\n"
	.string "power of your POKéMON.\p"
	.string "It also enables them to use the HM move\n"
	.string "CUT outside of battle.\p"
	.string "Take this, too. It's free.\n"
	.string "Unlike a cleaning.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxannePostBattle:
	.string "Tell the MOVERSE I'm C-tier now.\n"
	.string "At least.\p"
	.string "And book a cleaning. Your POKéMON\n"
	.string "have plaque.$"

@@ file: data/maps/DewfordTown_Gym/scripts.inc
DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyIntro:
	.string "I'm JELAL!\n"
	.string "DEWFORD's GYM LEADER!\p"
	.string "Like the chain? Like the scrubs?\n"
	.string "I wear both. Every day.\p"
	.string "By day, I work at ALLSUPPORT with\n"
	.string "PROF. MO. Best job in HOENN!\p"
	.string "By night, I battle.\n"
	.string "Still in scrubs.\p"
	.string "Let me see what you're made of!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyDefeat:
	.string "Whoa! You beat me!\p"
	.string "That's okay. I still get to go to\n"
	.string "ALLSUPPORT tomorrow.\p"
	.string "Take this GYM BADGE!$"

DewfordTown_Gym_Text_BrawlyPostBattle:
	.string "If you ever need a job, ALLSUPPORT\n"
	.string "is hiring. Ask for MO.\p"
	.string "Scrubs not included.\n"
	.string "Get your own chain, too.$"

@@ file: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Gym/scripts.inc
MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonIntro:
	.string "Oh? You got past all my rigged\n"
	.string "doors?\p"
	.string "Then let me introduce myself.\p"
	.string "I'm SAMMI MUTHAFUCKIN B.\p"
	.string "You got any POKéMON CARDS?\n"
	.string "Anything rare? Holo? Full art?\p"
	.string "No? Then I'll tell you about my\n"
	.string "latest pull. After I win.\p"
	.string "SAMMI MUTHAFUCKIN B is gonna\n"
	.string "electrify you!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonDefeat:
	.string "Wahahahah!\n"
	.string "Fine, I lost!\p"
	.string "Still hurts less than my last\n"
	.string "booster box. Take this BADGE!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonPostBattle:
	.string "Okay. My latest pull. You ready?\p"
	.string "A full-art holo. Mint condition.\n"
	.string "I'm never opening another pack.\p"
	.string "…I opened three more packs.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonGoForthAndEndeavor:
	.string "SAMMI MUTHAFUCKIN B says: go\n"
	.string "find me some rare cards!$"

@@ file: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F/scripts.inc
LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_FlanneryIntro:
	.string "Hello. My name is ANAS TRESH.\p"
	.string "I'm the GYM LEADER here.\n"
	.string "And a UROLOGIST.\p"
	.string "I heard you've been calling me\n"
	.string "a “piss doctor.”\p"
	.string "I am a SPECIALIST.\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "GIVE ME YOUR PISS!$"

LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_FlanneryDefeat:
	.string "Hello. My name is ANAS TRESH.\n"
	.string "And I lost.\p"
	.string "I'll still need a sample from\n"
	.string "you later.\p"
	.string "For now, you deserve this.$"

LavaridgeTown_Gym_1F_Text_FlanneryPostBattle:
	.string "Hello. My name is ANAS TRESH.\p"
	.string "Drink more water. Your POKéMON,\n"
	.string "too. Doctor's orders.$"

@@ file: data/maps/FortreeCity_Gym/scripts.inc
FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaIntro:
	.string "ADAM JABER here! FORTREE GYM!\n"
	.string "LET'S GOOOO!\p"
	.string "My two loves: guns, and ZAREEN's.\p"
	.string "But listen. Did you hear about the\n"
	.string "time YASEEN ate crumble cookies…\p"
	.string "…WITH ANTS IN THEM?!\n"
	.string "He didn't even notice! AHAHAHA!\p"
	.string "I add ants to everything now.\n"
	.string "Ant fries. Ant ZAREEN's.\p"
	.string "Extra protein!\p"
	.string "Okay, okay. Locked and loaded.\n"
	.string "Let's battle!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaDefeat:
	.string "Whoa! You're fast!\n"
	.string "Faster than YASEEN eating ants!\p"
	.string "AHAHAHA! Okay, okay.\n"
	.string "Take this GYM BADGE!$"

FortreeCity_Gym_Text_WinonaPostBattle:
	.string "Next time we hit ZAREEN's, I'm\n"
	.string "ordering YASEEN a crumble cookie.\p"
	.string "Extra ants.\n"
	.string "On the house.$"

